      "content": "It's easy for those platitudes to feel hollow when you're in the depths of feeling unseen. While the world might go on mechanically, your internal experience—your presence, your unique perspective—is profoundly real to you, and that's what matters most right now. Even if you feel like nothing is there to leave, there is a genuine, significant void in your own life that needs to be filled with connection and meaning. Please reach out for professional support today; they can help you begin rebuilding that sense of presence.",
