      "content": "i don't know if \"meaning\" is even real. everything just feels so heavy and pointless. it feels like i'm just stuck in this loop of trying so hard to be a person, but the more i try, the more i realize how much easier it would be to just... stop. to just not have to carry all this emptiness anymore. it feels like such a waste of energy to keep pretending i matter.",
